lay screen requires a production screen in order to function. The production screen allows you to track the progress of orders in the kitchen and trigger the automatic display of the \"ready\" status on the customer screen."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Est-ce que l’écran d’affichage client affiche toutes les commandes ?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, the customer display screen can show all orders that have been placed, regardless of the sales channel (cash register, kiosk, online order) or consumption mode (eat-in, take-out, delivery). You can filter the display according to your specific needs."}}]}]}</script>
