  </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq_text-wrapper">
                  <p class="tab_faq-text"><strong>1. Show orders only when they are ready</strong><br> With this mode, only orders that are finalized and ready to be delivered to customers appear on the screen.<br><br> <strong>2. Show all orders<br></strong> This mode allows you to view all orders, including those currently being prepared. Customers can thus track their order's preparation in real time.</p>
