  </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq_text-wrapper">
                  <p class="tab_faq-text">For greater fluidity, an automatic dispatch option allows ready orders to be displayed on the customer screen without intervention from the production screen. This feature can be activated directly from the back office or from the production screen. It allows you to adapt the customer flow based on available human resources. It is particularly useful in cases of understaffing.</p>
                </div>
              </a><a data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="faq-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link">
                <div class="faq-tab-heading-trigger">
