              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">No, the customer display screen requires a production screen to function. The production screen allows you to track the progress of orders in the kitchen and trigger the display of a ready order on the customer screen. Without it, it is not possible to control the sending or delivery of orders.<br></div>
