  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, the customer display screen can display all recorded orders, regardless of the sales channel (checkout, kiosk, online, etc.) or consumption method (dine-in, takeout, delivery). You can choose to display only ready orders or the entire flow, and filter by consumption type according to your needs.<br></div>
